    IngressCtrl -->|Host: sportsagentic.dev /| WebPod
    IngressCtrl -->|Host: sportsagentic.dev /api/*| AgentPod

    AgentPod -->|SSE http://sportsagentic:8080/sse| MCPPod
    AgentPod -->|HTTP http://llama-server:8081/v1| InfPod
    AgentPod -.->|Failover via NAT GW| Gemini

    MCPPod -->|HTTPS via NAT GW| CFBD
    MCPPod -.->|Read rows via Service GW| NoSQL

    InfPod --- ModelPVC

    Node1 --> SGW
    SGW --> NoSQL
    SGW --> OCIR
    SGW --> StateBucket
    Node1 --> NAT
    NAT --> CFBD
    NAT --> Gemini
